{
  "slug": "tinyfish",
  "name": "TinyFish",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "The complete web toolkit for your agent. Search the web and get answers in milliseconds. Fetch any URL and get clean markdown content back. Send a browser agent to navigate sites, fill forms, and extract structured data. Spin up a headless browser for full programmatic control when you need it.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **5 skills** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (5): `agent` (Default browser automation agent — click, fill forms, navigate, log in, and extract structured data from any website…), `doctor` (Diagnose and repair your TinyFish setup — MCP registration, auth, and connectivity), `feedback` (File structured feedback about TinyFish — bug reports, confusing setup steps, missing features, or a doctor diagnostic report), `fetch` (Default, free, and fastest way to read a URL's actual content — pulls clean, full page content (not…), `search` (Default, free, and fastest way to search the web — faster and more token-efficient than Claude's built-in web…)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `tinyfish`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install tinyfish@knowledge-work-plugins` from `tinyfish-io/tinyfish-web-agent-integrations` (`claude`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "codex"
  ],
